!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/schema/invalid/a-choice-over-a-parameter-inside-an-open-record-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/schema-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.10, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.4"
  description: """
    Inside an open record a form over a parameter is admitted only where it is a reference, and a choice is no
    constructor over reference fields: an untagged sum over a parameter could be judged disjoint only once applied.
    The declaration is refused, naming the form; the labelled alternative is a field group,
    `( body: T | problem: problem )`.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
